{"id":"6dc86f1b6e","t":"I’m Stuck on a Remote Island With the Male Leads","c":"cv","n":56,"l":56,"s":["ml","az"],"k":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads","az":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads"},"u":1795330113211,"desc":"حكي المانهوا عن فتاه امتلكت الشخصية مارغريت، الشريرة التي كان مصيرها الموت على يد الأبطال بعد تعذيب البطلة، وحتى تتمكن من البقاء على قيد الحياة، يجب أن تهرب من الأبطال. وبينما كانت على وشك الهرب تم تدمير خططها منذ البداية وتعرضت للكثير من المصائب في الجزيرة النائية مع الأبطال الذين كرهوها. لكن بدأ الرجال المجانين الذين كان من المفترض أن يكونوا مهووسين بالبطلة يهتمون بها. علاوة على ذلك، يبدو أن لهذه الجزيرة الاستوائية الغريبة سرًا عميقًا لم تدركه بعد.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال","رومانسى","كوميدى","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads","az":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/1/","az":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/series/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/2/"},"3":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/3/"},"4":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/4/"},"5":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/5/"},"6":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/6/"},"7":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/7/"},"8":{"ml":"im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads|/manga/im-stuck-on-a-remote-island-with-the-male-leads/8/"},"9":{"ml":"